  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tre 216.02 Notice. Notice of the date, time and place for hearings shall be by publication in the rulemaking register as required by RSA 541-A.\n\nSource. #9575-A, eff 10-22-09 (formerly 215.03)",
